# Build context lives at the repo root (Beak uses path dependencies, so the
# Docker build needs the whole packages/ + examples/ tree). This trims the heavy,
# regenerable, or irrelevant parts. Source is kept; artifacts are dropped.
#
# Note: pubspec_overrides.yaml files are melos-managed and gitignored. Dropping
# them here makes the image resolve from each package's committed pubspec.yaml
# (which already carries the path deps), so the build is reproducible without a
# melos bootstrap.

.git/
.github/
.idea/
.dart_tool/
**/.dart_tool/
build/
**/build/
coverage/
**/coverage/
**/pubspec_overrides.yaml
**/*.iml
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
docs/
site/
_site/
*.log
.env
**/.env

# Local databases, uploads and analysis indexes never belong in an image.
.codegraph/
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
**/uploads/
